 <h3><u>Munazera</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ek mufti muje dosto kal raat mila tha<br> mehdi ka mukhalif tha ye chehre pe likha tha<br> Imaan pe mere zarb lagane pe tula tha<br> mai uske irade pe bohot dil me hasa tha<br> Kehta tha ye ghaybat muje afsana lage hai<br> Maine kaha tu bhi muje deewana lage hai</p> 
  <p>Har chiz nazar aaye zaruri nahi mufti<br> Hoore bhi nahi dekhi hai imaan hai phir bhi<br> Ashabe kahf per bhi tuje shak nahi koi<br> Phir kyu na zahanat bhi hase aql pe teri<br> Tu jisko gumaan maan raha hai wo yaqeen hai<br> Shaytan ka qael to hai Mehdi ka nahi hai</p> 
  <p>Ye Sunke hi marne laga wo bugz ka maara<br> baaz aaya nahi fir bhi wo shaytan ka pyara<br> Ek baar kiya fir use zillat ne ishara<br> Aur haath rakhe dil pe wo chillaya bichara<br> Is waqt bata mujko tera mehdi kaha hai<br> Maine kaha Allah jaha hai wo waha hai</p> 
  <p>Ye sunke wo kehne laga tauba ha re tauba<br> Mehdi ko tu Allah ke jaisa hai samajta<br> Maine kaha Padh likh ke bhi jaahil hai tu beta<br> Kya khaak teri aql ne Allah ko jaana<br> Gar uska wali Haaziro naaziro nahi hoga<br> Allah ke hone ka pata kaise chalega</p> 
